{"post": true, "caption": "A daily loss limit is a number you set before you trade. Hit it, and you close the app for the day.\nIt works because the trades after a losing streak are often about winning money back fast, not about your plan.\nStart simple: risk a small fixed amount per trade and stop after 3 losses in a day. Write it down where you can see it.\nDo you have a daily loss limit? Yes or no.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #TradingForBeginners #OneGoodHabit #RiskManagement #TradingDiscipline", "tag": "ONE GOOD HABIT", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 100, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 120, "lines": [{"t": "LOST 3 TODAY?", "c": "red"}, {"t": "STOP.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.8, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "One rule saves", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "beginner accounts.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Watch this.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "It's called a", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "daily loss limit.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "Hit it. You're done.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 6.0, "title": "Same bad day, $1,000", "subtitle": "risking $10 per trade", "rows": [{"l": "Stop at 3 losses", "v": 30, "vl": "-$30", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "No limit, 8 losses", "v": 80, "vl": "-$80", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}, {"l": "Revenge, size x2", "v": 310, "vl": "-$310", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 3.0, "label": "With a limit, a bad day costs", "value": "-3%", "note": "Revenge trading cost 31%.", "c": "green"}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.2, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "You can't control", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "every loss.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "You control", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "when you stop.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.2, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "Start today:", "c": "muted"}, {"t": "pick your number", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "before you trade.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "Trade with a system, not a feeling."}]}